# Point the Way: "Start your engines!" gives Bot1 speed 1 as it enters. "{3}{G}, Sacrifice this enchantment: Search your library for
# up to X basic land cards, where X is your speed. Put those cards onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle." At speed 1 the
# search takes at most one basic land: two at once are refused, and so is Tropical Island, which has basic land types but is not
# basic (CR 205.4c; the refusals). The Forest arrives tapped; Point the Way is in the graveyard (sacrificed as a cost).

